2141%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/79/Cut_through_the_roof_%285442141%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cut_through_the_roof_(5442141).jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=157842962","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2025-01-12 17:45:49","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Cut through the roof (5442141)","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"PD US National Guard|Files created by the United States National Guard with known IDs|Bulgaria photographs taken on 2019-06-05|DVIDS files uploaded by OptimusPrimeBot|Milimedia files, Bulgaria (review needed)|Military firefighters of the United States","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"Michigan Army National Guard Sgt. Scott Clark, a firefighter with the 1442nd Firefighting Team and deputy with the Kalkaska Sheriff\u2019s Department, explains how modified chainsaws can be used to cut through the roof of a burning building without causing it to collapse June 6, 2019 at Novo Selo Training Area in Bulgaria. Thankfully, this equipment hasn\u2019t been needed as of yet during their rotation at NSTA. \u201cSometimes there are faults on alarms, or people smoking indoors,\u201d Ruether said. \"They\u2019re all DOD-compliant buildings, which cuts your fire-load down.\u201d STRIKE BACK 19 is a multinational exercise hosted by the Bulgarian Armed Forces at Novo Selo Training Area, Bulgaria, from June 6-20, 2019. STRIKE BACK 19 is designed to increase capabilities and interoperabilities with Bulgarian, Albanian, Greek, North Macedonian and U.S. Troops.\n(Michigan Army National Guard photo by Spc. Samantha Hall)\u2028","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"Taken on\u00a05 June 2019","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<table class=\"layouttemplate sourcetemplate\" style=\"width:100%; clear:both; text-align:center; margin:0.5em auto; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0; border-spacing: 8px; background-color: var(--background-color-neutral-subtle, #f6f7f5); color: var(--color-base, #202122); border: var(--border-subtle, 1px solid #555555);\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/NGB-seal.svg/120px-NGB-seal.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/NGB-seal.svg/250px-NGB-seal.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"670\" data-file-height=\"670\"></span></span>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span class=\"layouttemplateargs\" style=\"display:none;speak:none;\" title=\"template=ID-USMil 1%3D190605-Z-SD713-2006 2%3DNational+Guard url%3Dhttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.dvidshub.net%2Fimage%2F5442141\">\u00a0</span>\nThis image was released by the United States National Guard with the <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Commons:VIRIN\" title=\"Commons:VIRIN\">ID</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.dvidshub.net/image/5442141\">190605-Z-SD713-2006</a> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=Category:Files_created_by_the_United_States_National_Guard_with_known_IDs&amp;filefrom=190605-Z-SD713-2006#mw-category-media\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=Category:Files_created_by_the_United_States_National_Guard_with_kno